WEBVTT

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:01.840
of your pre-retirement income.

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:05.096
Things have changed a lot

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:09.936
from when social security
was introduced back in 1935.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:14.176
Then, a 21-year-old male
had a 50 percent chance

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:16.560
of living until he was 65.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:20.136
So he retired at 60,

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.736
did a little fishing,
kissed his grandkids,

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:24.416
got his gold watch --

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:27.960
he'd be dead within five years
of receiving benefits.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.776
That's not the pattern today.